WEBVTT

1
00:00.900 --> 00:05.745
Tap Bottom, then press it again and keep holding. That holds the mouse button down.

2
00:05.895 --> 00:07.815
Turn the wand to drag.

3
00:07.965 --> 00:09.832
Release Bottom to drop.

4
00:09.982 --> 00:15.219
A plain hold scrolls instead, so always tap first when you want to drag or select text.
